1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,620
What if your best friend didn't want to

2
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:02,660
play Roblox anymore?

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,280
Roblox is for babies.

4
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:05,480
I quit.

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,520
You what?

6
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:07,740
Day 1.

7
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,020
You send a game invite.

8
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:09,860
Declined.

9
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:10,760
Day 2.

10
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:12,880
You gift a legendary dragon pet.

11
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,060
Return to sender.

12
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:15,120
Day 3.

13
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:17,300
You build a giant sign across the whole

14
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:17,560
map.

15
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:18,860
Please come back.

16
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,100
Day 4.

17
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,040
The whole server joins in.

18
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,520
A thousand players spamming come back.

19
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,120
Everyone who subscribes gets a best friend who

20
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:27,920
never quits.

21
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,880
Day 5.

22
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,759
You peek through their window.

23
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:34,840
They're playing Roblox on a secret account.

24
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,660
Totally not me 1, 2, 3.

25
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,080
Okay, okay.

26
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,360
I didn't quit.

27
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,820
I've been stuck on the same obby jump

28
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,080
for a whole month.

29
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:45,340
It's the first jump.

30
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,580
The tutorial one.

31
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:50,020
Bro, I'll carry you.

32
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,040
Come and carry if you'd help your friend

33
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:52,320
too.

34
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,840
I fell again.
